OL,8,     GVaughan Williams's Fantasia on a
OL,9,     GTheme by Thomas Tallis and other
OL,10,     Gclassics for strings from John
OL,11,     GWilson and his Sinfonia of
OL,12,     GLondon. Live from the Barbican in
OL,13,     GLondon.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Electronic Women
OL,15,     GHannah Peel delves into the
OL,16,     Gsounds and stories of five female
OL,17,     Gelectronic pioneers. Tonight
OL,18,     Ginventor, visionary composer and
OL,19,     Gco-founder of the BBC Radiophonic
OL,20,     GWorkshop, Daphne Oram.
